 to Robinhood Chain:** send 247500 units, which arrive as 246666. Cost $1.40.\n5. **Move the other half to Arbitrum:** send 247500 units, which arrive as 246666. Cost $1.40.\n6. **Robinhood Chain:** swap 246666 WBTC units to about 0.04923 ETH. Cost $0.36.\n7. **Arbitrum:** swap 246666 WBTC units to about 147.70 USDC. Cost $0.36.\n\n**Expected end state:**\n- **Ethereum wallet:** about 0.0465 ETH, enough to keep paying gas.\n- **Robinhood Chain wallet:** about 0.0500 ETH.\n- **Arbitrum wallet:** about 147.70 USDC, plus about 0.0008 ETH for gas.\n\nDo you approve this route, or do you want to set a lower cost cap?"}]},{"role":"user","sequence":21,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_8"},"id":"toolu_01VQGtuQ36BPDHiHeFsYDWeX"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_9\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01VQGtuQ36BPDHiHeFsYDWeX","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_9"},"id":"toolu_015ZFf6gHbKxgSaWDsXHc8rd"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_015ZFf6gHbKxgSaWDsXHc8rd","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_016ioV29chKwZbZTZHt2ycvc"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_016ioV29chKwZbZTZHt2ycvc","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","nam